# s89-along.pad — S89: along free06's railway bed, from s89-rails.toml's "along" state.
#
# Wall-clock at a quarter speed, so every game second is 4000 ms here: a second idle, eight on the gas
# (cross), two and a half on the brake (square), the gas again, then a second of half-left stick at
# speed (the turn on the rails) and two straight, and the pad let go.
#
#   ./kit record watch/s89-rails.toml --state 9 --pad watch/pads/s89-along.pad -n 600
sleep 4000
down cross
sleep 32000
up cross
down square
sleep 10000
up square
down cross
sleep 14000
stick l -0.5 0
sleep 4000
stick l 0 0
sleep 8000
release
